    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BROE auctioneers welcomes you to a substantial three-bedroom, three bathroom residence built (2006) with the benefit cul de sac location. This fine home has been upgraded to exact standards and is in excellent condition throughout. It is further enhanced by a magnificent walled south east facing low maintenance private rear garden. Accommodation briefly comprises entrance hallway, guest WC, a generously proportioned open plan living room and kitchen/dining room makes for comfortable family living. Upstairs three spacious bedrooms master ensuite and main family bathroom contributed, making this an ideal family home. \r\n\r\nViewing highly recommended.\r\n\r\nContact Craig Leap of BROE auctioneers to register your interest."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\t\t        4.98m x 1.89m\t\tAlarmed, laminated wood flooring, storage.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\t\t\t2.24m x 1.71m\t\tGreat size, WC, WHB also plumbed for \twashing machine.      \r\n               \r\nLiving room\t\t\t4.63m x 3.01m\t \tOpen fireplace, recess lighting, laminated wood flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room\t5.10m x 4.64m\t\tGreat range of modern floor & eye level units, to include integrated appliances & 4 ring gas hob, french doors to rear garden, recess lighting.\r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom (1) \t\t       5.06m x 3.10m\r\n\r\nEnsuite\t\t\t       1.92m x 1.74m\t\tNewly revamped, WC, WHB & vanity unit, corner shower with Triton T90sr electric shower, heated towel radiator, fully tiled.\t  \r\n                                           \r\nBedroom (2) \t\t       4.40m x 3.14m\t\r\n\r\nBedroom (3) \t\t       2.75m x 1.98m\t\tStandalone wardrobe, \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\t      2.17m x 1.74m\t\tWC, WHB & bath, tiled around bath and tile flooring. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note any information, statement, description, quantity or measurement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuations or hand out issued by or on behalf of BROE auctioneers are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any mistake, omission, inaccuracy or mis description given orally or contained in any sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuation or hand out issues by BROE auctioneers. Agents shall not give rise to any right of action, claim, entitlement or compensation against BROE auctioneers. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by carrying out their own independent due diligence, inspections or otherwise as to the correctness of any and all the information, statements, descriptions, quantity or measurements contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuation or hand out issued by BROE auctioneers. The services, systems and appliances shown have not been tested and no warranty is made or given by BROE auctioneers as to their operability or efficiency."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tG. F.C.H.\r\n•\tDouble glazing & composite door.\r\n•\tLow maintenance south east facing rear garden.\r\n•\tSought after location.\r\n•\tOff street parking.\r\n•\tBeside variety of parks and green spaces.\r\n•\tGreat transport links in the area.\r\n•\tContact BROE auctionneers to register your interest."
      },
